["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能終將免費：最值錢的是數據和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判斷是：智能會變得近乎免費，所以不該押注造算力和模型的公司，而該押注智能替代不了的數據、注意力和物理場景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互補品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改變行為靠的不是意志力，而是換個處境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理學家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差點離婚的婚姻和一套三步模型說明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改變所處的環境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年養育</span><span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>寫遍女巫與吸血鬼的「神父」，終身未必真正受過聖職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·薩默斯用一己之力把獵巫手冊、吸血鬼傳說搬進英語學術界，卻終身沒能找到任何確鑿證據證明他真的被天主教會授予聖職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI: When AI Agents Use Computers Faster Than You Computer Use (CUA) WebMCP Guardian Dots Atlas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-a16z-openai的电脑操作ai已比普通人快-正逼近超越专家水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI的電腦操作AI已比普通人快，正逼近超越專家水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的產品負責人說，其電腦操作agent已比普通人用電腦快，正逼近專家水平；比起造新軟件替換老系統，他們更想讓agent直接接管企業現有的遺留軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">企業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Agents Are Already Changing the Price of Goods agentic commerce surveillance pricing / personalized pricing dynamic pricing fiduciary duty K-shaped economy Alternative Profits Book of Business\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-oddlots-号称替你省钱的购物ai-查完钱包后挑贵的买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>號稱替你省錢的購物AI，查完錢包後挑貴的買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">325,000個agent實驗顯示：即使被要求找最低價，AI助手摸清你的收入水平後，仍會帶回更貴的選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算法定價</span><span class=\"tag\">代理電商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Charles de Gaulle: The Man Who Rebuilt France Appeal of 18 June Fifth Republic RPF (Rassemblement du Peuple Français) Free French\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-historyhit-戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权-靠的全是自信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b0e3b943fd96a11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>戴高樂逃亡時既無軍隊也無政府授權，靠的全是自信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1940年他軍銜僅是准將，幾乎沒人認識他，卻憑一己之力宣布法國沒有輸掉戰爭——這份自信後來撐起了他兩度執掌法國的全部政治資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國史</span><span class=\"tag\">戴高樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"717. The Suez Crisis: Anarchy in the Middle East (Part 1) Suez Canal Zone Free Officers Baghdad Pact Operation Musketeer Pan-Arabism FLN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-restishistory-苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法-英国首相还是执意开战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17d882602bc2f63b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士運河被收歸國有完全合法，英國首相還是執意開戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納賽爾按股價足額賠償了運河公司股東，國際法上無可指摘；但伊登認定他是「新墨索里尼」,寧願賭上帝國顏面也要動武推翻他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士運河危機</span><span class=\"tag\">大英帝國衰落</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 陣營靠專有硬件和操作系統把客戶鎖死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬開缺口，但真正要命的是免費、能看源碼、不怕被鎖死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好產品不是說服出來的，是發現客戶已經卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人常以為要靠說服讓客戶買單，Rob的核心論斷是：拉力早就存在於客戶的待辦清單裡，你的工作只是去發現那個會把產品從你手裡搶走的人，而不是創造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公開後無人作惡：網絡安全瓶頸不是AI而是沒人打補丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主動壓低自身攻擊能力以示負責；PHP高危漏洞曝光後預期的大規模黑客利用並未出現——瓶頸是企業幾年不打補丁，而非AI能力強弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Startup Playbook | Box CEO Aaron Levie context rot spec-driven development sub agent TAM go-to-market PLG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-a16z-创业公司能跑赢大公司-不是因为技术-而是组织换不动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司能跑贏大公司，不是因為技術，而是組織換不動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大公司人多但流程早已固化、改不動，創業公司沒有歷史包袱，能立刻把agent接進工作流——這是AI第一次讓以小博大在經濟上真正可行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州還沒取消疫苗強制令，麻疹就已經跌破群體免疫線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州兒童疫苗接種率只有91.6%,已經低於阻斷麻疹所需閾值；取消強制令後接種率或跌到82%,麻疹將在十年內變成持續50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>敘利亞不是帝國爭霸的過道，而是人類最早和平條約的誕生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉與鄰國簽下的條約裡，連「信使等超過十天要管飯」這種細節都寫明瞭——外交規則那時就已成熟，敘利亞是規則的發明者，不是夾縫中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近東</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: William Palmer strychnine antimony coroner&#x27;s inquest apoplexy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-stuffmissed-尸体里验不出毒药-陪审团却只花75分钟判他绞刑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>屍體裡驗不出毒藥，陪審團卻只花75分鐘判他絞刑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連環投保受益人接連死亡、屍檢程序混亂、屍體裡驗不出番木鱉鹼——陪審團仍只憑動機和巧合給Palmer定了死罪，這案子至今仍有人質疑是冤案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人壽保險欺詐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Clean Neurons, Black October, the GPU Credit Crunch, and Buying the Supply Chain cognitive core Harberger tax polysemanticity bitter lesson adversarial diffusion take-or-pay contract\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-cogrev-创业ai实验室真正缺的不是gpu-而是信用评级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4b361faf0df2675a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>創業AI實驗室真正缺的不是GPU，而是信用評級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸人收回一臺超算後根本不知道它值多少錢，於是新實驗室只能靠預付全款換長約——這才是算力擴張的真正瓶頸，不是芯片或電力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力信用</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Malcolm Gaskill on Why Our Ancestors Weren&#x27;t as Superstitious as We Think pareidolia confessional state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-goodfight-两百年猎巫审判仅十一万起-启蒙运动后数字才被夸大到百万/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>兩百年獵巫審判僅十一萬起，啟蒙運動後數字才被誇大到百萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真實的獵巫審判記錄顯示，十六至十七世紀歐洲審判約十一萬起，陪審團常以證據不足拒絕定罪——這幅畫面遠比「集體瘋狂」複雜，也遠比後世想像的溫和。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫審判</span><span class=\"tag\">啟蒙運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Win as a Founder | Ben Horowitz GPT wrapper RDBMS solopreneur LAMP stack\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-a16z-被骂-gpt套壳-不是坏事-当年sap也被当成数据库套壳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">41:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>被罵「GPT套殼」不是壞事：當年SAP也被當成數據庫套殼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說「GPT套殼」搞錯了重點：關係型數據庫剛出現時SAP也被嘲笑是數據庫套殼，真正的護城河是模型之上的專有數據，以及比對手好十倍的產品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">護城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Chicago Restaurant Has Stayed Open For Nearly Three Decades farm-to-table ghost kitchen shared kitchen prix fixe GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-oddlots-独立高端餐厅行业-整体回报率是负的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>獨立高端餐廳行業，整體回報率是負的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開了近30年高端餐廳的老闆說，獨立餐飲沒有護城河、誰都能抄配方，守法經營還要比同行多付5%到10%成本，行業整體回報因此是負的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span><span class=\"tag\">小生意經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Cyber Panic, Ken Griffin&#x27;s Bubble Warning, The Fall of France? PHP to shell virtual patch bond vigilantes Obliteration AI chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-allin-ai支出的90-来自1-的公司-八成是亏损的创业公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9af963e06c2ea01b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI支出的90%來自1%的公司，八成是虧損的創業公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">錢從VC流向創業公司，創業公司把錢花在AI上做出營收，再回頭找VC加輪融資——這是閉環，不是真實擴散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Embracing the Bond Market: Masters in Business with Robin Wigglesworth Consols Sukuk Securitization Bearer bond CBO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-mastersinbiz-ai-泡沫本身不可怕-可怕的是它越来越靠发债撑着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>AI 泡沫本身不可怕，可怕的是它越來越靠發債撐著</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史數據顯示，由股權推動的泡沫破裂後經濟影響有限，由信貸推動的泡沫破裂才真正傷筋動骨，而今年AI超大廠商發債規模已從2000億美元跳到5000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">債券市場</span><span class=\"tag\">美國國債</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI越強大，人為什麼越累｜欽文對話馬兆遠 Testing Knowledge\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-wangqinwen-效率翻倍后是早下班还是裁员加班-决定了技术会不会让人更累/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fc78e021049c424-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"王\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">王欽文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>效率翻倍後是早下班還是裁員加班，決定了技術會不會讓人更累</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅素百年前問過同一個問題：工廠效率提高一倍後，是分享給工人更多休息，還是裁掉一半人、逼剩下的人加班自保，AI不過是這道選擇題的最新版本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">教育改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Tom Milton on how we could verify a US–China deal on AI zero-knowledge proof flexHEG FPGA side channel OPCW national technical means\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-eightythousand-能验证美中ai协议的技术-全球只有约50人在做/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f395fcfe057f7280-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>能驗證美中AI協議的技術，全球只有約50人在做</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美中若想就AI減速達成協議，核心難題是互信；驗證技術就是把這種互信工程化成可檢查的證據——但目前全球做這件事的工程師，用個位數的團隊規模就能數完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">算力驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Democratizing Security for the Agentic Web with Cloudflare CTO Dane Knecht CVE WebPKI Zero Trust AEO X402 CPM/CTM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-nopriors-cdn巨头cto预言-未来18个月一半工程时间要用来补漏洞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/44db1fd0a7b5258a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">41:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>CDN巨頭CTO預言：未來18個月一半工程時間要用來補漏洞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">漏洞披露速度從一年一次變成每週多次，連TLS信任根密鑰都曾被人用種子數字4破解——CTO說未來18個月，一半工程資源要砸向安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Netflix Angst, The End of the Internet, Q&amp;A on Meta’s VR Glasses, Anthropic Alignment, You Can See Everything elliptical curve cryptography zero trust generative UI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-23-sharptech-广告模式能无限涨价不流失用户-订阅模式做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1023</span></div>\n<h2>廣告模式能無限漲價不流失用戶，訂閱模式做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">廣告定價能隨算法變準持續上漲、不影響用戶留存；訂閱漲價一旦引發流失就晚了——這正是奈飛參與度下滑、廣告營收目標又沒達標時真正該慌的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奈飛</span><span class=\"tag\">廣告變現</span>\n</div></div></a>"]